The changes made to those files are: the namespace was changed from
`Percolation.Literature` to `LatticeProb`, the percolation-specific sections and
their imports were removed, and the module documentation was rewritten to
describe the general statements alone.  The mathematical statements and their
proofs are unchanged.

The files under LatticeProb/Lattice/Planar/ are adapted from
https://github.com/nitromannitol/rotor-23,
commit 703754d6dd0c4ae190d08b89f4507bd14b847d4e, copyright 2026
Ahmed Bou-Rabee and Yuval Peres, under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE). They preserve the lattice geometry and contour proofs,
with reduced imports, a new namespace and ASCII declaration spellings.
The retained exploration and cyclic-order definitions support the S/W
contour argument. No percolation library dependency is included.

Files not named above are original to this repository.
